{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31446","headline":"句 · 崔橹","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"强半瘦因前夜雪，数枝愁向晚天来。\n无人解把无尘袖，盛取残香尽日怜。\n一番春雨吹巢冷，半朵山花咽觜香。\n云生柱础降龙地，露洗林峦放鹤天。\n菱叶乍翻人采後，荇花初没舸行时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔橹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}